\newlabel{tab:vcycle-tv}{{6}{20}{K=4 V-cycle benchmark: TV distance vs.\ pair-level ground truth and wall-clock timing. All methods solve from $t=0$ to $t_f = 2$ with step size $\Delta t = 0.2$. V-cycle methods use pre-smoothing time $\tau _{\mathrm {pre}} = 1/(d\,n_{\mathrm {low}}+1) \approx 0.39\,\mathrm {s}$.\relax }{table.caption.184}{}}
